    "detailed_description": "<h1>Funded Day 1 on Kickstarter</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127600/extras/79f15e5758188e418365ebccf5bafc12.avif?t=1741552265\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thank you to all our Boned Backers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will be using this money to develop a DLC featuring new maps, new characters, and more hats! Expect to see this DLC in the Spring of 2025 for more ways to Bone!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boned is a silly, fast-paced multiplayer party game, inspired by arcade beloved Killer Queen and other multi-player frenzies! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of a canine astronaut and launch into space. Drill through planets, slingshot around gravitational fields, and bring your team to victory. Collect toys by drilling into the planet cores, then fire it off to eliminate enemies, or take it back to home base to score for your team. Make sure to keep an eye out for \u201cThe Bone\u201d, too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127600/extras/ef8f85706470602629859834bf0f386d.poster.avif?t=1741552265\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127600/extras/ef8f85706470602629859834bf0f386d.webm?t=1741552265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127600/extras/ef8f85706470602629859834bf0f386d.mp4?t=1741552265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Achieve victory in one of three exciting win conditions:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exhaust all of your opponents\u2019 lives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver 8 toys to your home base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig up \u201cThe Bone\u201d and hold onto it in a tug-of-war!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127600/extras/2554bc317dfde290622493764c68e7c2.poster.avif?t=1741552265\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127600/extras/2554bc317dfde290622493764c68e7c2.webm?t=1741552265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127600/extras/2554bc317dfde290622493764c68e7c2.mp4?t=1741552265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boned has plenty of awesome features that\u2019ll keep you coming back for more and more:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovingly crafted retro-futuristic style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Different Dogs to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn titles based on your performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated bark button.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for? <strong>Get Boned today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: A controller is required for local multiplayer.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boned is a silly, fast-paced multiplayer party game, inspired by arcade beloved Killer Queen and other multi-player frenzies! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of a canine astronaut and launch into space. Drill through planets, slingshot around gravitational fields, and bring your team to victory. Collect toys by drilling into the planet cores, then fire it off to eliminate enemies, or take it back to home base to score for your team. Make sure to keep an eye out for \u201cThe Bone\u201d, too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127600/extras/ef8f85706470602629859834bf0f386d.poster.avif?t=1741552265\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127600/extras/ef8f85706470602629859834bf0f386d.webm?t=1741552265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127600/extras/ef8f85706470602629859834bf0f386d.mp4?t=1741552265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Achieve victory in one of three exciting win conditions:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exhaust all of your opponents\u2019 lives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver 8 toys to your home base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig up \u201cThe Bone\u201d and hold onto it in a tug-of-war!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127600/extras/2554bc317dfde290622493764c68e7c2.poster.avif?t=1741552265\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127600/extras/2554bc317dfde290622493764c68e7c2.webm?t=1741552265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127600/extras/2554bc317dfde290622493764c68e7c2.mp4?t=1741552265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boned has plenty of awesome features that\u2019ll keep you coming back for more and more:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovingly crafted retro-futuristic style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Different Dogs to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn titles based on your performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated bark button.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for? <strong>Get Boned today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: A controller is required for local multiplayer.</i></p>",
